    "reading": "G067 put the flat/planes crossover at 2.9367 bits with WEIGHT-fitted planes. Fitting the same ladder against functional error moves it, and the direction is the result: the band in which the planes family is the better mechanism gets wider, because the fitting rule rather than the family was spending planes on directions the activations do not use."
